// 월 단위 공무동 배부: 대표 일 공무동 전력 × 해당 월 일수 × 예비소성·본소성 전력 비율
function calculate(){
  const lineState=getLineState(), month=monthPicker.value, monthDays=monthDates(month);
  if(!records.length){alert('생산 기록을 하나 이상 추가해주세요.');return}
  const detailMap=new Map();
  records.filter(r=>lineState[r.line]?.active).forEach(r=>{
    const operatingDays=daysInclusive(r.start,r.end,month);
    if(operatingDays>0) detailMap.set(r.id,{r,days:operatingDays,furnace:0,aux:0,utility:0,predictions:[]});
  });
  const activeLines=[...new Set([...detailMap.values()].map(x=>x.r.line))];
  if(!activeLines.length){alert('선택한 월에 생산기간이 포함된 가동 라인이 없습니다.');return}
  const season=seasonFromMonth(month),cfaTotal=activeLines.reduce((s,l)=>s+Number(lineState[l].cfa||0),0),cdaTotal=activeLines.reduce((s,l)=>s+Number(lineState[l].cda||0),0),airDay=cfaTotal+cdaTotal,lineCount=activeLines.length;
  const utilityDaily=predictUtilityDaily(season,cfaTotal,airDay,lineCount);
  const util=Object.fromEntries(Object.entries(utilityDaily).map(([k,v])=>[k,v.kwh*monthDays.length]));
  const furnaceByLine=Object.fromEntries(activeLines.map(l=>[l,0])),utilityBasisByLine=Object.fromEntries(activeLines.map(l=>[l,0]));
  detailMap.forEach(x=>{
    const procPred=PROCESSES.filter(p=>x.r.enabled[p.key]).map(p=>predictFurnace(x.r,p,1,season));
    const dailyFurnace=procPred.reduce((s,p)=>s+p.energy,0),dailyBasis=procPred.filter(p=>['예비소성','본소성A','본소성B'].includes(p.process)).reduce((s,p)=>s+p.energy,0);
    x._monthlyBasis=dailyBasis*x.days;x.furnace=dailyFurnace*x.days;x.aux=(AUX_DAILY_KWH[x.r.line]||12000)*x.days;x.predictions=procPred;
    furnaceByLine[x.r.line]+=x.furnace;utilityBasisByLine[x.r.line]+=x._monthlyBasis;
  });
  const plantBasis=Object.values(utilityBasisByLine).reduce((s,v)=>s+v,0),utilTotal=Object.values(util).reduce((s,v)=>s+v,0);
  detailMap.forEach(x=>{
    const lineShare=plantBasis?utilityBasisByLine[x.r.line]/plantBasis:0,sameLineBasis=[...detailMap.values()].filter(y=>y.r.line===x.r.line).reduce((s,y)=>s+y._monthlyBasis,0),productShare=sameLineBasis?x._monthlyBasis/sameLineBasis:0;
    x.utility=utilTotal*lineShare*productShare;x.total=x.furnace+x.aux+x.utility;x.intensity=x.r.qty?x.total/x.r.qty:0;delete x._monthlyBasis;
  });
  const details=[...detailMap.values()],totalFurnace=Object.values(furnaceByLine).reduce((s,v)=>s+v,0),airTotal=airDay*monthDays.length;
  lastResult={details,util,airTotal,totalFurnace,utilTotal,furnaceByLine,auxByLine:{}};renderResults();saveState();
}

function renderResults(){
  const {details,totalFurnace,utilTotal}=lastResult;
  const total=details.reduce((s,x)=>s+x.total,0),qty=details.reduce((s,x)=>s+Number(x.r.qty||0),0),auxTotal=details.reduce((s,x)=>s+x.aux,0),directTotal=totalFurnace+auxTotal;
  kpiGrid.innerHTML=[['총 전력량',fmt(total),'kWh'],['총 생산량',fmt(qty,0),'kg'],['전력 원단위',fmt(qty?total/qty:0,3),'kWh/kg'],['공무동 예측',fmt(utilTotal),'kWh']].map(x=>`<div class="kpi"><div class="kpi-label">${x[0]}</div><div class="kpi-value">${x[1]}<span class="kpi-unit">${x[2]}</span></div></div>`).join('');
  renderTariffEstimate(total);
  resultBody.closest('table').querySelector('thead tr').innerHTML='<th>라인</th><th>제품</th><th>열처리 생산량 (kg)</th><th>로 전력</th><th>外 설비(집진기 포함)</th><th>공무동(유틸동) 전력</th><th>총 전력</th><th>전력 원단위</th>';
  resultBody.innerHTML=details.map(x=>`<tr><td>${x.r.line}</td><td>${x.r.product}</td><td>${fmt(x.r.qty,0)}</td><td>${fmt(x.furnace)}</td><td>${fmt(x.aux)}</td><td>${fmt(x.utility)}</td><td>${fmt(x.total)}</td><td>${fmt(x.intensity,3)}</td></tr>`).join('');
  status('계산 완료',true);renderPowerComposition(directTotal,utilTotal,total);renderDonut(details);renderBars(details);
}

// 날짜별 가동라인 수와 날짜별 CFA·CDA를 반영하는 월 집계 로직
function calculate(){
  const lineState=getLineState(),active=LINES.filter(l=>lineState[l].active);
  if(!records.length){alert('생산 기록을 하나 이상 추가해주세요.');return}
  const month=monthPicker.value,days=monthDates(month),recordDates=new Map(records.map(r=>[r.id,fullDateSet(r.start,r.end)])),detailMap=new Map(),furnaceByLine=Object.fromEntries(active.map(l=>[l,0])),auxByLine=Object.fromEntries(active.map(l=>[l,0])),util={'Air Compressor':0,'냉동식 Dryer':0,'흡착식 Dryer':0,'CO2 Removal':0};
  let airTotal=0;
  records.filter(r=>lineState[r.line]?.active).forEach(r=>detailMap.set(r.id,{r,days:0,furnace:0,aux:0,utility:0,utilityBasisTotal:0,heatQty:Number(r.qty||0),heatFurnace:0,predictions:[]}));
  for(const day of days){
    const activeEntries=[...detailMap.values()].filter(x=>{const dates=recordDates.get(x.r.id);return PROCESSES.some(p=>x.r.enabled[p.key]&&dates?.has(shiftedDateKey(day,PROCESS_LAG_DAYS[p.key]))) }),activeLines=[...new Set(activeEntries.map(x=>x.r.line))];
    if(!activeLines.length){
      const base=baseUtilityForDay(day);
      Object.keys(util).forEach(k=>util[k]+=base?.[k]||0);
      continue;
    }
    const season=seasonFromMonth(day),cfaTotal=activeLines.reduce((s,l)=>s+Number(lineState[l].cfa||0),0),cdaTotal=activeLines.reduce((s,l)=>s+Number(lineState[l].cda||0),0),airDay=cfaTotal+cdaTotal;
    airTotal+=airDay;
    const utilPred=predictUtilityDaily(season,cfaTotal,airDay,activeLines.length),utilDay=Object.fromEntries(Object.entries(utilPred).map(([k,v])=>[k,v.kwh]));
    Object.keys(util).forEach(k=>util[k]+=utilDay[k]||0);
    const furnaceDayByLine=Object.fromEntries(activeLines.map(l=>[l,0])),utilityBasisDayByLine=Object.fromEntries(activeLines.map(l=>[l,0]));
    activeEntries.forEach(x=>{
      x.days+=1;
      const procPred=PROCESSES.filter(p=>x.r.enabled[p.key]&&recordDates.get(x.r.id)?.has(shiftedDateKey(day,PROCESS_LAG_DAYS[p.key]))).map(p=>predictFurnace(x.r,p,1,season)),dailyFurnace=procPred.reduce((s,p)=>s+p.energy,0),dailyBasis=procPred.filter(p=>['예비소성','본소성A','본소성B'].includes(p.process)).reduce((s,p)=>s+p.energy,0);
      const dailyHeat=procPred.filter(p=>p.process==='열처리').reduce((s,p)=>s+p.energy,0),dustDaily=DUST_DAILY_KWH[x.r.line]||0; x._dayFurnace=dailyFurnace;x._dayUtilityBasis=dailyBasis;x.furnace+=dailyFurnace;x.utilityBasisTotal+=dailyBasis;x.heatFurnace+=dailyHeat;x.aux+=(AUX_DAILY_KWH[x.r.line]||12000)+dustDaily;x.dust=(x.dust||0)+dustDaily;x.predictions=procPred;furnaceDayByLine[x.r.line]+=dailyFurnace;utilityBasisDayByLine[x.r.line]+=dailyBasis;
    });
    const plantUtilityBasis=Object.values(utilityBasisDayByLine).reduce((s,v)=>s+v,0),utilityDayTotal=Object.values(utilDay).reduce((s,v)=>s+v,0);
    activeEntries.forEach(x=>{
      const lineShare=plantUtilityBasis?utilityBasisDayByLine[x.r.line]/plantUtilityBasis:0,sameLineEntries=activeEntries.filter(y=>y.r.line===x.r.line),sameLineBasis=sameLineEntries.reduce((s,y)=>s+(y._dayUtilityBasis||0),0),productShare=sameLineBasis?(x._dayUtilityBasis||0)/sameLineBasis:0;
      x.utility+=utilityDayTotal*lineShare*productShare;
    });
    Object.entries(furnaceDayByLine).forEach(([line,v])=>furnaceByLine[line]+=v);
  }
  const details=[...detailMap.values()].filter(x=>x.days>0);
  const utilTotal=Object.values(util).reduce((s,v)=>s+v,0),allocatedUtility=details.reduce((s,x)=>s+x.utility,0),unallocatedUtility=Math.max(0,utilTotal-allocatedUtility),basisTotal=details.reduce((s,x)=>s+x.utilityBasisTotal,0);
  details.forEach(x=>{const share=basisTotal?x.utilityBasisTotal/basisTotal:(details.length?1/details.length:0);x.utility+=unallocatedUtility*share;x.total=x.furnace+x.aux+x.utility;x.intensity=x.r.qty?x.total/x.r.qty:0;x.heatIntensity=x.heatQty?x.heatFurnace/x.heatQty:0;delete x.utilityBasisTotal;delete x._dayFurnace;delete x._dayUtilityBasis});
  const totalFurnace=Object.values(furnaceByLine).reduce((s,v)=>s+v,0);
  lastResult={details,util,airTotal,totalFurnace,utilTotal,furnaceByLine,auxByLine};renderResults();saveState();
}

function refreshFillAverage(recordId,processKey){const r=records.find(x=>x.id===recordId);if(!r)return;const c=r.conditions[processKey];c.fill=(Number(c.fillTop||0)+Number(c.fillMid||0)+Number(c.fillBottom||0))/3;const avg=conditionCards.querySelector(`[data-average="${recordId}"][data-p="${processKey}"]`);if(avg)avg.innerHTML=`<small>평균 충진량</small><strong>${fmt(c.fill,1)} kg</strong>`;if(processKey==='mainA'&&!r.bimodal){r.conditions.mainB.fillTop=c.fillTop;r.conditions.mainB.fillMid=c.fillMid;r.conditions.mainB.fillBottom=c.fillBottom;r.conditions.mainB.fill=c.fill}}
function sharedCondition(rec,proc){return proc.key==='mainB'&&rec.bimodal?rec.conditions.mainB:proc.key==='mainB'?rec.conditions.mainA:rec.conditions[proc.key]}
function renderConditions(){const lineState=getLineState(),visibleRecords=records.filter(r=>lineState[r.line]?.active);conditionCards.innerHTML=visibleRecords.length?visibleRecords.map(r=>{const conditionProcesses=r.bimodal?PROCESSES.filter(p=>p.key==='pre'||p.key==='heat'||(p.key==='mainA'&&r.enabled.mainA&&r.enabled.mainB)||(p.key==='mainB'&&r.enabled.mainA&&r.enabled.mainB)):INPUT_PROCESSES.filter(p=>p.key==='mainA'?r.enabled.mainA&&r.enabled.mainB:r.enabled[p.key]);return `<div class="condition-card"><div class="condition-card-title"><div><h4>${r.line} · ${r.product}</h4><small>${r.start} ~ ${r.end}</small></div><span class="condition-summary">${conditionProcesses.length}개 공정${r.bimodal?' · Bimodal':''}</span></div>${conditionProcesses.length?`<div class="condition-process-list">${conditionProcesses.map(p=>{const c=r.conditions[p.key];return `<div class="condition-process-group"><div class="condition-process-header"><strong>${p.inputName||p.name}</strong><span>${p.inlet}/${p.outlet} Hz</span></div><div class="fill-row"><label><span>상단</span><input class="condition-input" data-cid="${r.id}" data-p="${p.key}" data-c="fillTop" type="number" step="0.1" value="${c.fillTop}"></label><label><span>중단</span><input class="condition-input" data-cid="${r.id}" data-p="${p.key}" data-c="fillMid" type="number" step="0.1" value="${c.fillMid}"></label><label><span>하단</span><input class="condition-input" data-cid="${r.id}" data-p="${p.key}" data-c="fillBottom" type="number" step="0.1" value="${c.fillBottom}"></label><div class="average-fill" data-average="${r.id}" data-p="${p.key}"><small>평균 충진량</small><strong>${fmt(c.fill,1)} kg</strong></div></div><div class="condition-secondary"><label><span>소성시간 (hr)</span><input class="condition-input" data-cid="${r.id}" data-p="${p.key}" data-c="time" type="number" step="0.1" value="${c.time}"></label><label><span>로 온도 (°C)</span><input class="condition-input" data-cid="${r.id}" data-p="${p.key}" data-c="temp" type="number" step="1" value="${c.temp}"></label></div></div>`}).join('')}</div>`:'<p class="muted">생산기간 및 생산량 입력에서 운전 공정을 선택하세요.</p>'}</div>`}).join(''):'<p class="muted">생산기간 및 생산량 입력에서 가동 라인을 체크하면 공정별 운전조건이 표시됩니다.</p>';conditionCards.querySelectorAll('[data-cid]').forEach(el=>el.addEventListener('input',()=>{const r=records.find(x=>x.id===el.dataset.cid),v=Number(el.value);r.conditions[el.dataset.p][el.dataset.c]=v;if(el.dataset.c.startsWith('fill'))refreshFillAverage(r.id,el.dataset.p);if(el.dataset.p==='mainA'&&!r.bimodal&&!el.dataset.c.startsWith('fill'))r.conditions.mainB[el.dataset.c]=v;saveState()}))}

function markNewProductTestConditions(){records.filter(r=>r.newProductTest).forEach(r=>{const fields=conditionCards.querySelectorAll(`[data-cid="${r.id}"]`);fields.forEach(el=>{el.value='';el.closest('.condition-card')?.classList.add('new-product-test-card')});conditionCards.querySelectorAll(`[data-average="${r.id}"]`).forEach(el=>{el.innerHTML='<small>평균 충진량</small><strong>입력 필요</strong>'})})}
const _renderConditions=renderConditions;renderConditions=function(){_renderConditions();markNewProductTestConditions()};markNewProductTestConditions();
